+    ///
+    /// # Effects
+    ///
+    /// - Updates the `blocks_to_swap_out` map with new GPU to CPU block mappings.
+    /// - Changes the status of affected sequences in the group from `Running` to `Swapped`.
+    /// - Frees up GPU memory by moving data to CPU memory.
+    ///
